                        <span class="fs-20 d-inline-block mb-15px text-base-color">Renta y Administración Profesional de Inmuebles</span> 
                        <h3 class="alt-font fw-500 text-dark-gray ls-minus-1px shadow-none" data-shadow-animation="true" data-animation-delay="700">Reciba su renta <span class="fw-700 text-highlight d-inline-block">Sin preocupaciones<span class="bg-base-color h-10px bottom-1px opacity-3 separator-animation"></span></span></h3> 
